Package: fcitx5-evkey
Architecture: any
Depends: fcitx5 (>= 5.1.7), fcitx5-data, python3-qtpy, python3-dbus, python3-pyqt5, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}
Description: Vietnamese input method for Fcitx 5
 EVKey Linux Community is a Vietnamese input method for Fcitx 5.
 It is community software inspired by EVKey, using Lotus/Bamboo; it is not an
 official EVKey release. Preedit and Fake Backspace require no privileged
 helper.

Package: fcitx5-evkey-uinput
Architecture: any
Depends: fcitx5-evkey (= ${binary:Version}), systemd, udev, acl, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: optional uinput helper for fcitx5-evkey
 This optional helper enables EVKey Linux Community Smooth mode. It runs as
 the dedicated evkey-input system account and can inject keys into an active
 local desktop session. It is never enabled automatically.
